entries.def:
ἤπερ, see: ἤ.
ἤ, 
disjunctive and comparative particle (Bl., §36, 12; 77, 11); 
__1. disjunctive, or; 
__(a) between single words: Mat.5.17 Mrk.6.56, Luk.2.24, Jhn.6.19, Rom.1.21, al.; 
__(b) before a sentence expressing a variation, denial or refutation of a previous statement, frequently in interrog. form: Mat.7.4, 9 Mrk.12.14, Luk.13.4, Rom.3.29; 6.3; 9.21, 1Co.6.9, 16 9:6, 2Co.11.7 ἤ . . . ἤ, either . . . or,…
